    "Approve this device from an already-paired OpenClaw client. In your OpenClaw chat, run `/pair approve`, then click **Check connection** again.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approve this device from an already-paired OpenClaw client. In your OpenClaw chat, run `/pair approve`, then click **Check connection** again."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"从已配对的 OpenClaw 客户端批准此设备。在 OpenClaw 聊天中运行 `/pair approve`，然后再次点击**检查连接**。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"從已配對的 OpenClaw 用戶端核准此裝置。在您的 OpenClaw 聊天中執行 `/pair approve`，然後再次點擊**檢查連線**。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprove este dispositivo em um cliente OpenClaw já pareado. No seu chat do OpenClaw, execute `/pair approve` e clique em **Verificar conexão** novamente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Genehmigen Sie dieses Gerät über einen bereits gekoppelten OpenClaw-Client. Führen Sie in Ihrem OpenClaw-Chat `/pair approve` aus und klicken Sie dann erneut auf **Verbindung prüfen**."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprueba este dispositivo desde un cliente de OpenClaw ya vinculado. En tu chat de OpenClaw, ejecuta `/pair approve` y vuelve a hacer clic en **Comprobar conexión**."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ペアリング済みのOpenClawクライアントからこのデバイスを承認してください. OpenClawのチャットで`/pair approve`を実行し、もう一度**接続を確認**をクリックしてください."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이미 페어링된 OpenClaw 클라이언트에서 이 기기를 승인하세요. OpenClaw 채팅에서 `/pair approve`를 실행한 다음 **연결 확인**을 다시 클릭하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approuvez cet appareil depuis un client OpenClaw déjà appairé. Dans votre conversation OpenClaw, exécutez `/pair approve`, puis cliquez à nouveau sur **Vérifier la connexion**."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"पहले से पेयर किए गए OpenClaw क्लाइंट से इस डिवाइस को मंज़ूरी दें। अपनी OpenClaw चैट में `/pair approve` चलाएँ, फिर **कनेक्शन जाँचें** पर दोबारा क्लिक करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"وافق على هذا الجهاز من عميل OpenClaw مقترن بالفعل. في محادثتك مع OpenClaw، شغّل `/pair approve`، ثم انقر على **التحقق من الاتصال** مرة أخرى."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approva questo dispositivo da un client OpenClaw già abbinato. Nella tua chat OpenClaw, esegui `/pair approve`, quindi fai di nuovo clic su **Verifica connessione**."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu cihazı önceden eşleştirilmiş bir OpenClaw istemcisinden onaylayın. OpenClaw sohbetinizde `/pair approve` komutunu çalıştırın, ardından **Bağlantıyı kontrol et** seçeneğine tekrar tıklayın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схваліть цей пристрій із уже спареного клієнта OpenClaw. У чаті OpenClaw виконайте `/pair approve`, а потім знову натисніть **Перевірити з’єднання**."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setujui perangkat ini dari klien OpenClaw yang sudah dipasangkan. Di obrolan OpenClaw Anda, jalankan `/pair approve`, lalu klik **Periksa koneksi** lagi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdź to urządzenie w już sparowanym kliencie OpenClaw. Na czacie OpenClaw uruchom `/pair approve`, a następnie ponownie kliknij **Sprawdź połączenie**."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"อนุมัติอุปกรณ์นี้จากไคลเอนต์ OpenClaw ที่จับคู่ไว้แล้ว. ในแชท OpenClaw ของคุณ ให้เรียกใช้ `/pair approve` จากนั้นคลิก **ตรวจสอบการเชื่อมต่อ** อีกครั้ง."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt thiết bị này từ một ứng dụng OpenClaw đã được ghép đôi. Trong cuộc trò chuyện OpenClaw, chạy `/pair approve`, rồi nhấp lại vào **Kiểm tra kết nối**."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keur dit apparaat goed vanuit een al gekoppelde OpenClaw-client. Voer in je OpenClaw-chat `/pair approve` uit en klik daarna opnieuw op **Verbinding controleren**."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"این دستگاه را از طریق یک کلاینت OpenClaw که از قبل جفت شده است تأیید کنید. در گفتگوی OpenClaw خود، `/pair approve` را اجرا کنید، سپس دوباره روی **بررسی اتصال** کلیک کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Одобрите это устройство из уже сопряжённого клиента OpenClaw. В чате OpenClaw выполните `/pair approve`, затем снова нажмите **Проверить подключение**."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godkänn den här enheten från en redan parkopplad OpenClaw-klient. Kör `/pair approve` i din OpenClaw-chatt och klicka sedan på **Kontrollera anslutningen** igen."}}}},
    "Approve this request": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approve this request"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"批准此次请求"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核准此請求"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovar esta solicitação"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diese Anfrage genehmigen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobar esta solicitud"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このリクエストを承認"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 요청 승인"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approuver cette requête"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस अनुरोध को स्वीकृति दें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الموافقة على هذا الطلب"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approva questa richiesta"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu isteği onayla"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалити цей запит"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setujui permintaan ini"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdź to żądanie"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"อนุมัติคำขอนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt yêu cầu này"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dit verzoek goedkeuren"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأیید این درخواست"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Одобрить этот запрос"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godkänn denna begäran"}}}},
    "Approve this request (⌘Return)": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approve this request (⌘Return)"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"批准此次请求（⌘Return）"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核准此請求（⌘Return）"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovar esta solicitação (⌘Return)"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diese Anfrage genehmigen (⌘Return)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobar esta solicitud (⌘Return)"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このリクエストを承認（⌘Return）"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 요청 승인 (⌘Return)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approuver cette requête (⌘Retour)"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस अनुरोध को स्वीकृति दें (⌘Return)"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الموافقة على هذا الطلب (⌘Return)"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approva questa richiesta (⌘Invio)"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu isteği onayla (⌘Return)"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалити цей запит (⌘Return)"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setujui permintaan ini (⌘Return)"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdź to żądanie (⌘Return)"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"อนุมัติคำขอนี้ (⌘Return)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt yêu cầu này (⌘Return)"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dit verzoek goedkeuren (⌘Return)"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأیید این درخواست (⌘Return)"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Одобрить этот запрос (⌘Return)"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godkänn denna begäran (⌘Return)"}}}},
    "Approving this repair replaces the device’s access token.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approving this repair replaces the device’s access token."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"批准此次修复将替换设备的访问令牌。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核准此次修復將取代裝置的存取權杖。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovar este reparo substitui o token de acesso do dispositivo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Genehmigung dieser Reparatur ersetzt das Zugriffstoken des Geräts."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobar esta reparación reemplaza el token de acceso del dispositivo."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この修復を承認すると、デバイスのアクセストークンが置き換えられます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 복구를 승인하면 기기의 액세스 토큰이 교체됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’approbation de cette réparation remplace le jeton d’accès de l’appareil."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस सुधार को स्वीकृति देने से डिवाइस का एक्सेस टोकन बदल जाएगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تؤدي الموافقة على هذا الإصلاح إلى استبدال رمز الوصول الخاص بالجهاز."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’approvazione di questa riparazione sostituisce il token di accesso del dispositivo."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu onarımı onaylamak, cihazın erişim belirtecini değiştirir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалення цього відновлення замінить токен доступу пристрою."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menyetujui perbaikan ini akan mengganti token akses perangkat."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdzenie tej naprawy zastępuje token dostępu urządzenia."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การอนุมัติการซ่อมแซมนี้จะเปลี่ยนโทเค็นการเข้าถึงของอุปกรณ์"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt thao tác sửa chữa này sẽ thay thế mã thông báo truy cập của thiết bị."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Als u dit herstel goedkeurt, wordt het toegangstoken van het apparaat vervangen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأیید این ترمیم، توکن دسترسی دستگاه را جایگزین می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Одобрение этого восстановления заменит токен доступа устройства."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Om du godkänner den här reparationen ersätts enhetens åtkomsttoken."}}}},
    "Archive": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archive"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"归档"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"封存"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arquivar"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivar"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アーカイブ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"보관"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiver"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"संग्रहित करें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أرشفة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivia"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arşivle"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Архівувати"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arsipkan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiwizuj"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เก็บถาวร"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lưu trữ"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiveer"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بایگانی"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Архив"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arkivera"}}}},
    "Archived": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archived"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已归档"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已封存"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arquivado"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiviert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivado"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アーカイブ済み"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"보관됨"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivé"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"संग्रहित"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مؤرشف"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiviati"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arşivlendi"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Архівовано"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diarsipkan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zarchiwizowane"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เก็บถาวรแล้ว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã lưu trữ"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gearchiveerd"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بایگانی‌شده"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"В архиве"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arkiverad"}}}},
    "Ask Discord": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ask Discord"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"询问 Discord"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"詢問 Discord"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Perguntar ao Discord"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Discord fragen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preguntar a Discord"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Discordに質問"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Discord에 물어보기"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demander à Discord"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Discord से पूछें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اسأل Discord"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiedi a Discord"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Discord'a Sor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запитати Discord"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tanya Discord"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zapytaj Discord"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ถาม Discord"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hỏi Discord"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vraag het Discord"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"پرسش از Discord"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Спросить Discord"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fråga Discord"}}}},
    "Ask before every shell command.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ask before every shell command."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每次执行 shell 命令前询问。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行每個 shell 命令前都先詢問。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Perguntar antes de cada comando de shell."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vor jedem Shell-Befehl nachfragen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preguntar antes de cada comando de shell."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"シェルコマンドの実行前に毎回確認します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 셸 명령 실행 전에 확인합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demander avant chaque commande shell."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हर शेल कमांड से पहले पूछें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"طلب الموافقة قبل كل أمر صدفة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiedi prima di ogni comando shell."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her kabuk komutundan önce sor."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запитувати перед кожною командою оболонки."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tanyakan sebelum setiap perintah shell."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pytaj przed każdym poleceniem powłoki."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ถามก่อนเรียกใช้คำสั่งเชลล์ทุกครั้ง."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hỏi trước mỗi lệnh shell."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vragen vóór elke shellopdracht."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"پیش از اجرای هر فرمان شل اجازه بپرس."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запрашивать подтверждение перед каждой командой оболочки."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fråga före varje skalkommando."}}}},
    "Ask on Allowlist Miss": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ask on Allowlist Miss"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未命中允许列表时询问"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不在允許清單中時詢問"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Perguntar quando não estiver na lista de permissões"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bei fehlendem Eintrag in der Zulassungsliste nachfragen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preguntar si no está en la lista de permitidos"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"許可リストにない場合に確認"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"허용 목록에 없으면 확인"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demander si absent de la liste d’autorisation"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अनुमति सूची में न होने पर पूछें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"طلب الموافقة عند عدم الإدراج في قائمة السماح"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiedi se non presente nell'elenco dei consentiti"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"İzin Listesinde Yoksa Sor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запитувати за відсутності у списку дозволених"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tanyakan Jika Tidak Ada dalam Daftar Izin"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pytaj przy braku na liście dozwolonych"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ถามเมื่อไม่อยู่ในรายการที่อนุญาต"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hỏi khi không có trong danh sách cho phép"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vragen als de opdracht niet op de toestemmingslijst staat"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"در صورت نبودن در فهرست مجاز اجازه بپرس"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запрашивать подтверждение, если нет в списке разрешённых"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fråga om kommandot saknas i tillåtelselistan"}}}},
    "Ask only when a command is not trusted yet.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ask only when a command is not trusted yet."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅在命令尚未受信任时询问。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅在命令尚未受信任時詢問。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Perguntar apenas quando um comando ainda não for confiável."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nur nachfragen, wenn ein Befehl noch nicht als vertrauenswürdig eingestuft ist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preguntar solo cuando un comando aún no sea de confianza."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"コマンドがまだ信頼されていない場合のみ確認します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 신뢰되지 않은 명령인 경우에만 확인합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demander uniquement lorsqu’une commande n’est pas encore considérée comme fiable."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"केवल तब पूछें जब कोई कमांड अभी तक विश्वसनीय न हो।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"طلب الموافقة فقط عندما لا يكون الأمر موثوقًا بعد."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiedi solo quando un comando non è ancora attendibile."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yalnızca bir komut henüz güvenilir değilse sor."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запитувати, лише коли команда ще не є довіреною."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tanyakan hanya jika perintah belum dipercaya."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pytaj tylko wtedy, gdy polecenie nie jest jeszcze zaufane."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ถามเฉพาะเมื่อคำสั่งยังไม่ได้รับความเชื่อถือ."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chỉ hỏi khi một lệnh chưa được tin cậy."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alleen vragen wanneer een opdracht nog niet wordt vertrouwd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فقط زمانی اجازه بپرس که فرمان هنوز مورد اعتماد نیست."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запрашивать подтверждение, только если команда ещё не является доверенной."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fråga bara när ett kommando ännu inte är betrott."}}}},
    "Ask, create, and automate": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ask, create, and automate"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提问、创建和自动化"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提問、創作與自動化"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pergunte, crie e automatize"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fragen, erstellen und automatisieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pregunta, crea y automatiza"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"質問、作成、自動化"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"질문, 생성 및 자동화"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demandez, créez et automatisez"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"पूछें, बनाएँ, और स्वचालित करें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اسأل، وأنشئ، وأتمت"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiedi, crea e automatizza"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sor, oluştur ve otomatikleştir"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запитуйте, створюйте й автоматизуйте"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bertanya, membuat, dan mengotomatiskan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pytaj, twórz i automatyzuj"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ถาม, สร้าง, และทำงานอัตโนมัติ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hỏi, tạo và tự động hóa"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vraag, creëer en automatiseer"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بپرسید، بسازید و خودکار کنید"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Спрашивайте, создавайте и автоматизируйте"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fråga, skapa och automatisera"}}}},
