    "Continue a recent conversation": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continue a recent conversation"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"继续最近的对话"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"繼續最近的對話"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar uma conversa recente"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eine kürzlich geführte Unterhaltung fortsetzen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar una conversación reciente"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近の会話を続ける"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"최근 대화 이어가기"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reprendre une conversation récente"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हाल की बातचीत जारी रखें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"متابعة محادثة حديثة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continua una conversazione recente"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Son konuşmalardan birine devam et"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продовжити нещодавню розмову"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lanjutkan percakapan terbaru"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontynuuj ostatnią rozmowę"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"สนทนาล่าสุดต่อ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tiếp tục cuộc trò chuyện gần đây"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Een recent gesprek voortzetten"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ادامهٔ یک گفتگوی اخیر"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продолжить недавний разговор"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fortsätt en tidigare konversation"}}}},
    "Continuously copy this Mac's logged-in cookies for the domains below into the remote OpenClaw browser profile. Off by default.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuously copy this Mac's logged-in cookies for the domains below into the remote OpenClaw browser profile. Off by default."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"持续将此 Mac 上以下域名的已登录 Cookie 复制到远程 OpenClaw 浏览器配置文件中。 默认关闭。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"持續將這部 Mac 上下列網域的已登入 Cookie 複製到遠端 OpenClaw 瀏覽器設定檔。預設為關閉。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar continuamente os cookies de sessões autenticadas deste Mac para os domínios abaixo para o perfil remoto do navegador OpenClaw. Desativado por padrão."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookies für angemeldete Sitzungen auf diesem Mac für die unten aufgeführten Domains kontinuierlich in das entfernte OpenClaw-Browserprofil kopieren. Standardmäßig deaktiviert."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copiar continuamente las cookies de las sesiones iniciadas en este Mac para los dominios indicados a continuación al perfil del navegador remoto de OpenClaw. Desactivado de forma predeterminada."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"以下のドメインについて、このMacのログイン済みCookieをリモートのOpenClawブラウザプロファイルに継続的にコピーします。 デフォルトではオフです。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아래 도메인에 대해 이 Mac의 로그인 쿠키를 원격 OpenClaw 브라우저 프로필에 지속적으로 복사합니다. 기본적으로 꺼져 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copier en continu les cookies de session de ce Mac pour les domaines ci-dessous vers le profil de navigateur OpenClaw distant. Désactivé par défaut."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नीचे दिए गए डोमेन के लिए इस Mac की लॉग-इन कुकीज़ को रिमोट OpenClaw ब्राउज़र प्रोफ़ाइल में लगातार कॉपी करें. डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से बंद है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نسخ ملفات تعريف الارتباط لجلسات تسجيل الدخول على جهاز Mac هذا باستمرار للنطاقات أدناه إلى ملف تعريف متصفح OpenClaw البعيد. معطّل افتراضيًا."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia continuamente i cookie di autenticazione di questo Mac per i domini elencati di seguito nel profilo del browser OpenClaw remoto. Disattivato per impostazione predefinita."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu Mac'te aşağıdaki alan adları için oturum açma çerezlerini uzak OpenClaw tarayıcı profiline sürekli olarak kopyalayın. Varsayılan olarak kapalıdır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Постійно копіювати файли cookie активних сеансів входу на цьому Mac для наведених нижче доменів у віддалений профіль браузера OpenClaw. Типово вимкнено."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salin cookie sesi masuk di Mac ini untuk domain di bawah secara terus-menerus ke profil browser OpenClaw jarak jauh. Nonaktif secara default."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na bieżąco kopiuj pliki cookie zalogowanych sesji z tego Maca dla poniższych domen do zdalnego profilu przeglądarki OpenClaw. Domyślnie wyłączone."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คัดลอกคุกกี้การเข้าสู่ระบบของ Mac เครื่องนี้สำหรับโดเมนด้านล่างไปยังโปรไฟล์เบราว์เซอร์ OpenClaw ระยะไกลอย่างต่อเนื่อง. ปิดไว้โดยค่าเริ่มต้น."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Liên tục sao chép cookie đăng nhập trên máy Mac này cho các miền bên dưới vào hồ sơ trình duyệt OpenClaw từ xa. Mặc định tắt."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopieer de aanmeldcookies van deze Mac voor de onderstaande domeinen continu naar het externe OpenClaw-browserprofiel. Standaard uitgeschakeld."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کوکی‌های نشست‌های واردشده در این Mac را برای دامنه‌های زیر، به‌طور پیوسته در نمایهٔ مرورگر OpenClaw راه‌دور کپی کنید. به‌طور پیش‌فرض غیرفعال است."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Постоянно копировать файлы cookie авторизованных сеансов с этого Mac для указанных ниже доменов в удалённый профиль браузера OpenClaw. По умолчанию отключено."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiera kontinuerligt inloggningscookies från denna Mac för domänerna nedan till OpenClaw-webbläsarprofilen på fjärrdatorn. Av som standard."}}}},
    "Control Terminal for automation actions; other apps request access separately": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control Terminal for automation actions; other apps request access separately"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制终端以执行自动化操作; 其他应用会单独请求访问权限"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制「終端機」以執行自動化動作; 其他應用程式會另外要求存取權限"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlar o Terminal para ações de automação; outros apps solicitam acesso separadamente"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terminal für Automatisierungsaktionen steuern; andere Apps fordern den Zugriff separat an"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlar Terminal para acciones de automatización; otras aplicaciones solicitan acceso por separado"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動化アクションのためにターミナルを制御します; 他のアプリは個別にアクセスを要求します"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"자동화 작업을 위해 터미널을 제어합니다; 다른 앱은 별도로 접근 권한을 요청합니다"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôler Terminal pour les actions d’automatisation ; les autres applications demandent l’accès séparément"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ऑटोमेशन कार्रवाइयों के लिए Terminal को नियंत्रित करें; अन्य ऐप अलग से ऐक्सेस का अनुरोध करते हैं"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"التحكم في Terminal لتنفيذ إجراءات الأتمتة؛ تطلب التطبيقات الأخرى إذن الوصول بشكل منفصل"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla Terminale per le azioni di automazione; le altre app richiedono l'accesso separatamente"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Otomasyon işlemleri için Terminal'i denetleyin; diğer uygulamalar ayrıca erişim ister"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керування Terminal для автоматизації дій; інші програми запитують доступ окремо"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kendalikan Terminal untuk tindakan otomatisasi; aplikasi lain meminta akses secara terpisah"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steruj aplikacją Terminal na potrzeby automatyzacji; inne aplikacje proszą o dostęp osobno"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุม Terminal สำหรับการดำเนินการอัตโนมัติ; แอปอื่นจะขอสิทธิ์เข้าถึงแยกต่างหาก"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Điều khiển Terminal để thực hiện các thao tác tự động hóa; các ứng dụng khác yêu cầu quyền truy cập riêng"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bedien Terminal voor automatiseringsacties; andere apps vragen afzonderlijk om toegang"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کنترل Terminal برای اقدامات خودکار؛ سایر برنامه‌ها جداگانه درخواست دسترسی می‌کنند"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управлять Терминалом для выполнения действий автоматизации; другие приложения запрашивают доступ отдельно"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Styr Terminal för automatiseringsåtgärder; andra appar begär åtkomst separat"}}}},
    "Control UI elements when an action requires it": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control UI elements when an action requires it"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在操作需要时控制 UI 元素"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在動作需要時控制使用者介面元素"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlar elementos da interface quando uma ação exigir"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"UI-Elemente steuern, wenn eine Aktion dies erfordert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlar los elementos de la interfaz cuando una acción lo requiera"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アクションで必要な場合にUI要素を制御します"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작업에 필요한 경우 UI 요소 제어"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôler les éléments de l’interface lorsqu’une action le nécessite"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"किसी कार्रवाई के लिए आवश्यक होने पर UI तत्वों को नियंत्रित करें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"التحكم في عناصر واجهة المستخدم عندما يتطلب الإجراء ذلك"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla gli elementi dell'interfaccia quando un'azione lo richiede"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bir işlem gerektirdiğinde kullanıcı arayüzü öğelerini denetleyin"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керування елементами інтерфейсу, коли цього потребує дія"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kendalikan elemen UI saat suatu tindakan memerlukannya"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steruj elementami interfejsu, gdy wymaga tego działanie"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุมองค์ประกอบ UI เมื่อการดำเนินการจำเป็นต้องใช้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Điều khiển các thành phần giao diện khi thao tác yêu cầu"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bedien UI-elementen wanneer een actie dit vereist"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کنترل عناصر رابط کاربری هنگامی که اقدامی به آن نیاز دارد"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управлять элементами интерфейса, когда этого требует действие"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Styr gränssnittselement när en åtgärd kräver det"}}}},
    "Control channel": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control channel"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制通道"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制通道"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canal de controle"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steuerungskanal"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canal de control"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"制御チャネル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"제어 채널"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canal de contrôle"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नियंत्रण चैनल"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"قناة التحكم"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canale di controllo"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Denetim kanalı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Канал керування"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saluran kontrol"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kanał sterowania"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ช่องทางควบคุม"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kênh điều khiển"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Besturingskanaal"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کانال کنترل"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Канал управления"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrollkanal"}}}},
    "Control how agent shell commands are approved on this Mac.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control how agent shell commands are approved on this Mac."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制此 Mac 上智能体 shell 命令的审批方式。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制這部 Mac 上代理程式 Shell 指令的核准方式。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controle como os comandos de shell do agente são aprovados neste Mac."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Festlegen, wie Shell-Befehle des Agenten auf diesem Mac genehmigt werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla cómo se aprueban los comandos de shell del agente en este Mac."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このMacでエージェントのシェルコマンドを承認する方法を設定します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Mac에서 에이전트 셸 명령을 승인하는 방식을 설정합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Définir comment les commandes shell de l’agent sont approuvées sur ce Mac."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नियंत्रित करें कि इस Mac पर एजेंट के शेल कमांड कैसे स्वीकृत किए जाते हैं."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"التحكم في كيفية الموافقة على أوامر الصدفة الخاصة بالوكيل على جهاز Mac هذا."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gestisci l'approvazione dei comandi shell dell'agente su questo Mac."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu Mac'te ajanın kabuk komutlarının nasıl onaylanacağını denetleyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Налаштуйте, як схвалюються команди оболонки агента на цьому Mac."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Atur cara perintah shell agen disetujui di Mac ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Określ, jak zatwierdzane są polecenia powłoki agenta na tym Macu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุมวิธีอนุมัติคำสั่งเชลล์ของเอเจนต์บน Mac เครื่องนี้."}