    "Deep links (openclaw://…) are always enabled; the key controls unattended runs.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep links (openclaw://…) are always enabled; the key controls unattended runs."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深层链接 (openclaw://…) 始终启用; 密钥用于控制无人值守运行。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深層連結 (openclaw://…) 一律啟用; 金鑰用於控制無人值守的執行。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Links diretos (openclaw://…) estão sempre habilitados; a chave controla execuções sem supervisão."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep-Links (openclaw://…) sind immer aktiviert; der Schlüssel steuert unbeaufsichtigte Ausführungen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los enlaces profundos (openclaw://…) siempre están habilitados; la clave controla las ejecuciones desatendidas."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ディープリンク (openclaw://…) は常に有効です; キーは無人実行を制御します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"딥 링크(openclaw://…)는 항상 활성화되어 있습니다; 키는 무인 실행을 제어합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les liens profonds (openclaw://…) sont toujours activés; la clé contrôle les exécutions sans supervision."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"डीप लिंक (openclaw://…) हमेशा सक्षम रहते हैं; कुंजी बिना निगरानी के होने वाले रन नियंत्रित करती है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الروابط العميقة (openclaw://…) مفعّلة دائمًا; يتحكم المفتاح في عمليات التشغيل دون إشراف."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I deep link (openclaw://…) sono sempre abilitati; la chiave controlla le esecuzioni non presidiate."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Derin bağlantılar (openclaw://…) her zaman etkindir; anahtar, gözetimsiz çalıştırmaları kontrol eder."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Глибокі посилання (openclaw://…) завжди ввімкнені; ключ керує запусками без 