    "Everyday OpenClaw app behavior.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Everyday OpenClaw app behavior."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 应用的日常行为。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 應用程式的日常行為。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportamento cotidiano do aplicativo OpenClaw."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alltägliches Verhalten der OpenClaw-App."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportamiento cotidiano de la aplicación OpenClaw."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawアプリの日常的な動作。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 앱의 일상적인 동작."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportement quotidien de l’application OpenClaw."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ऐप का रोज़मर्रा का व्यवहार।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"السلوك اليومي لتطبيق OpenClaw."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportamento quotidiano dell'app OpenClaw."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw uygulamasının günlük davranışı."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Повсякденна поведінка застосунку OpenClaw."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Perilaku sehari-hari aplikasi OpenClaw."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codzienne działanie aplikacji OpenClaw."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ลักษณะการทำงานประจำวันของแอป OpenClaw."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoạt động hằng ngày của ứng dụng OpenClaw."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dagelijks gedrag van de OpenClaw-app."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"رفتار روزمرهٔ برنامهٔ OpenClaw."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Повседневная работа приложения OpenClaw."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw-appens vardagliga beteende."}}}},
    "Everything runs where you decide, with permissions you grant.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Everything runs where you decide, with permissions you grant."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一切都在您指定的位置运行，并使用您授予的权限。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有功能都在您指定的位置執行, 並使用您授予的權限。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tudo é executado onde você decide, com as permissões que você concede."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles läuft dort, wo Sie es festlegen, mit den Berechtigungen, die Sie erteilen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todo se ejecuta donde tú decidas, con los permisos que concedas."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"すべての処理は、指定した場所で、付与した権限に基づいて実行されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 작업은 사용자가 지정한 위치에서 부여한 권한으로 실행됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tout s’exécute là où vous le décidez, avec les autorisations que vous accordez."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सब कुछ आपके तय किए गए स्थान पर, आपकी दी गई अनुमतियों के साथ चलता है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يعمل كل شيء حيثما تختار، وبالأذونات التي تمنحها."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutto viene eseguito dove decidi tu, con le autorizzazioni che concedi."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her şey sizin belirlediğiniz yerde, verdiğiniz izinlerle çalışır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усе працює там, де ви вирішите, з дозволами, які ви надасте."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semuanya berjalan di tempat yang Anda tentukan, dengan izin yang Anda berikan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wszystko działa tam, gdzie zdecydujesz, z uprawnieniami, których udzielisz."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ทุกอย่างทำงานในที่ที่คุณเลือก โดยใช้สิทธิ์ที่คุณอนุญาต."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mọi thứ chạy ở nơi bạn chọn, với các quyền bạn cấp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles draait waar jij dat bepaalt, met de machtigingen die jij verleent."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"همه‌چیز در جایی که شما تعیین می‌کنید و با مجوزهایی که شما می‌دهید اجرا می‌شود."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всё выполняется там, где вы решите, с разрешениями, которые вы предоставите."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allt körs där du bestämmer, med de behörigheter du beviljar."}}}},
    "Exact HTTPS hosts, separated by commas or spaces. Empty allows config SecretRefs only.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact HTTPS hosts, separated by commas or spaces. Empty allows config SecretRefs only."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"精确的 HTTPS 主机名，以逗号或空格分隔。留空则仅允许配置中的 SecretRefs。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"須完全符合的 HTTPS 主機, 以逗號或空格分隔。 留空時僅允許設定中的 SecretRefs."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hosts HTTPS exatos, separados por vírgulas ou espaços. Se estiver vazio, permite apenas SecretRefs da configuração."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exakte HTTPS-Hosts, durch Kommas oder Leerzeichen getrennt. Ein leeres Feld erlaubt nur SecretRefs aus der Konfiguration."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hosts HTTPS exactos, separados por comas o espacios. Si se deja vacío, solo se permiten SecretRefs de la configuración."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完全一致するHTTPSホストをカンマまたはスペースで区切って指定します。空の場合は設定内のSecretRefsのみが許可されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"정확한 HTTPS 호스트를 쉼표나 공백으로 구분하여 입력하세요. 비워 두면 구성의 SecretRefs만 허용됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Noms d’hôtes HTTPS exacts, séparés par des virgules ou des espaces. Si ce champ est vide, seuls les SecretRefs de la configuration sont autorisés."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सटीक HTTPS होस्ट, अल्पविराम या स्पेस से अलग किए गए। खाली होने पर केवल कॉन्फ़िगरेशन के SecretRefs की अनुमति है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أسماء مضيفي HTTPS الدقيقة، مفصولة بفواصل أو مسافات. ترك الحقل فارغًا يسمح فقط باستخدام SecretRefs في الإعدادات."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host HTTPS esatti, separati da virgole o spazi. Se vuoto, consente solo i SecretRefs della configurazione."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Virgül veya boşlukla ayrılmış tam HTTPS ana makine adları. Boş bırakılırsa yalnızca yapılandırmadaki SecretRefs değerlerine izin verilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Точні імена хостів HTTPS, розділені комами або пробілами. Порожнє поле дозволяє лише SecretRefs із конфігурації."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host HTTPS yang harus cocok persis, dipisahkan dengan koma atau spasi. Jika kosong, hanya SecretRefs konfigurasi yang diizinkan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dokładne nazwy hostów HTTPS, oddzielone przecinkami lub spacjami. Puste pole zezwala tylko na SecretRefs z konfiguracji."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ระบุโฮสต์ HTTPS ให้ตรงทุกตัวอักษร โดยคั่นด้วยจุลภาคหรือเว้นวรรค. หากเว้นว่างไว้ จะอนุญาตเฉพาะ SecretRefs ในการกำหนดค่าเท่านั้น."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tên máy chủ HTTPS chính xác, phân tách bằng dấu phẩy hoặc dấu cách. Để trống thì chỉ cho phép SecretRefs trong cấu hình."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exacte HTTPS-hosts, gescheiden door komma's of spaties. Als dit leeg is, zijn alleen SecretRefs uit de configuratie toegestaan."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نام دقیق میزبان‌های HTTPS، جداشده با ویرگول یا فاصله. خالی گذاشتن این بخش فقط SecretRefs پیکربندی را مجاز می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Точные имена HTTPS-хостов, разделённые запятыми или пробелами. Если поле пустое, разрешены только SecretRefs из конфигурации."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exakta HTTPS-värdar, avgränsade med kommatecken eller mellanslag. Tomt tillåter endast SecretRefs från konfigurationen."}}}},
    "Exec Approvals": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec Approvals"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"执行审批"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行核准"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovações de Execução"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ausführungsgenehmigungen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobaciones de ejecución"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実行の承認"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실행 승인"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approbations d’exécution"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"निष्पादन स्वीकृतियाँ"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"موافقات التنفيذ"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazioni di esecuzione"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yürütme Onayları"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалення виконання"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan Eksekusi"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zgody na wykonanie"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การอนุมัติการเรียกใช้คำสั่ง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt thực thi"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Goedkeuringen voor uitvoering"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأییدهای اجرا"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подтверждения выполнения"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Körningsgodkännanden"}}}},
    "Exec Approvals Unavailable": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec Approvals Unavailable"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"执行审批不可用"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行核准無法使用"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovações de Execução Indisponíveis"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ausführungsgenehmigungen nicht verfügbar"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobaciones de ejecución no disponibles"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実行の承認を利用できません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실행 승인을 사용할 수 없음"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approbations d’exécution indisponibles"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"निष्पादन स्वीकृतियाँ उपलब्ध नहीं हैं"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"موافقات التنفيذ غير متاحة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazioni di esecuzione non disponibili"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yürütme Onayları Kullanılamıyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалення виконання недоступні"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan Eksekusi Tidak Tersedia"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zgody na wykonanie niedostępne"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การอนุมัติการเรียกใช้คำสั่งไม่พร้อมใช้งาน"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt thực thi không khả dụng"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Goedkeuringen voor uitvoering niet beschikbaar"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأییدهای اجرا در دسترس نیست"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подтверждения выполнения недоступны"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Körningsgodkännanden är inte tillgängliga"}}}},
    "Exec approvals unavailable. Retry to refresh.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec approvals unavailable. Retry to refresh."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"执行审批不可用。请重试以刷新。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行核准無法使用。請重試以重新整理。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovações de execução indisponíveis. Tente novamente para atualizar."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ausführungsgenehmigungen nicht verfügbar. Zum Aktualisieren erneut versuchen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las aprobaciones de ejecución no están disponibles. Vuelve a intentarlo para actualizar."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実行の承認を利用できません。再試行して更新してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실행 승인을 사용할 수 없습니다. 새로고침하려면 다시 시도하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autorisations d’exécution indisponibles. Réessayez pour actualiser."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"निष्पादन अनुमोदन उपलब्ध नहीं हैं। रीफ़्रेश करने के लिए फिर से प्रयास करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"موافقات التنفيذ غير متاحة. أعد المحاولة للتحديث."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazioni di esecuzione non disponibili. Riprova per aggiornare."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Komut çalıştırma onayları kullanılamıyor. Yenilemek için tekrar deneyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Дозволи на виконання недоступні. Повторіть спробу, щоб оновити."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan eksekusi tidak tersedia. Coba lagi untuk menyegarkan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdzenia wykonania poleceń są niedostępne. Spróbuj ponownie, aby odświeżyć."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การอนุมัติการเรียกใช้คำสั่งไม่พร้อมใช้งาน. ลองอีกครั้งเพื่อรีเฟรช."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Không có yêu cầu phê duyệt thực thi. Thử lại để làm mới."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uitvoeringsgoedkeuringen niet beschikbaar. Probeer het opnieuw om te vernieuwen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأییدهای اجرا در دسترس نیستند. برای تازه‌سازی دوباره تلاش کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запросы на разрешение выполнения недоступны. Повторите попытку, чтобы обновить."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godkännanden för körning är inte tillgängliga. Försök igen för att uppdatera."}}}},
