    "Install one of these tools, then check again. You can also connect a provider below.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Install one of these tools, then check again. You can also connect a provider below."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安装其中一个工具，然后重新检查。你也可以在下方连接提供商。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安裝其中一項工具, 然後再次檢查。 您也可以在下方連接服務供應商。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instale uma destas ferramentas e verifique novamente. Você também pode conectar um provedor abaixo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installieren Sie eines dieser Tools und prüfen Sie dann erneut. Sie können auch unten einen Anbieter verbinden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instala una de estas herramientas y vuelve a comprobarlo. También puedes conectar un proveedor a continuación."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"これらのツールのいずれかをインストールしてから、もう一度確認してください。 以下でプロバイダーに接続することもできます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 도구 중 하나를 설치한 다음 다시 확인하세요. 아래에서 제공업체를 연결할 수도 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installez l’un de ces outils, puis vérifiez à nouveau. Vous pouvez également connecter un fournisseur ci-dessous."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इनमें से कोई एक टूल इंस्टॉल करें, फिर दोबारा जाँचें. आप नीचे किसी प्रदाता को भी कनेक्ट कर सकते हैं."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ثبّت إحدى هذه الأدوات، ثم تحقق مرة أخرى. يمكنك أيضًا ربط موفّر أدناه."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installa uno di questi strumenti, poi verifica di nuovo. Puoi anche collegare un provider qui sotto."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu araçlardan birini yükleyin, ardından tekrar kontrol edin. Ayrıca aşağıdan bir sağlayıcı bağlayabilirsiniz."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Встановіть один із цих інструментів, а потім перевірте ще раз. Ви також можете підключити постачальника нижче."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instal salah satu alat ini, lalu periksa lagi. Anda juga dapat menghubungkan penyedia di bawah ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zainstaluj jedno z tych narzędzi, a następnie sprawdź ponownie. Możesz też podłączyć dostawcę poniżej."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ติดตั้งเครื่องมือใดเครื่องมือหนึ่งต่อไปนี้ แล้วตรวจสอบอีกครั้ง. คุณยังสามารถเชื่อมต่อผู้ให้บริการด้านล่างได้."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cài đặt một trong các công cụ này, rồi kiểm tra lại. Bạn cũng có thể kết nối với một nhà cung cấp bên dưới."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installeer een van deze tools en controleer het daarna opnieuw. Je kunt hieronder ook een provider verbinden."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"یکی از این ابزارها را نصب کنید، سپس دوباره بررسی کنید. همچنین می‌توانید در بخش زیر یک ارائه‌دهنده را متصل کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Установите один из этих инструментов, затем проверьте снова. Вы также можете подключить провайдера ниже."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installera ett av dessa verktyg och kontrollera sedan igen. Du kan också ansluta en leverantör nedan."}}}},
    "Installed": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installed"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安裝"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instalada"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installiert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instalada"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"インストール済み"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설치됨"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installé"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इंस्टॉल किया गया"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مثبّت"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installata"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yüklendi"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Встановлено"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terinstal"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zainstalowano"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ติดตั้งแล้ว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã cài đặt"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geïnstalleerd"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نصب‌شده"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Установлено"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installerad"}}}},
    "Installed: %@ · Required: %@": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installed: %@ · Required: %@"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装: %@ · 所需: %@"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安裝: %@ · 需要: %@"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instalado: %@ · Necessário: %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installiert: %@ · Erforderlich: %@"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instalado: %@ · Requerido: %@"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"インストール済み: %@ · 必要: %@"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설치됨: %@ · 필요: %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installé : %@ · Requis : %@"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इंस्टॉल किया गया: %@ · आवश्यक: %@"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"المثبت: %@ · المطلوب: %@"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installato: %@ · Richiesto: %@"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yüklü: %@ · Gerekli: %@"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Встановлено: %@ · Потрібно: %@"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terinstal: %@ · Diperlukan: %@"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zainstalowane: %@ · Wymagane: %@"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ติดตั้งแล้ว: %@ · จำเป็น: %@"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã cài đặt: %@ · Bắt buộc: %@"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geïnstalleerd: %@ · Vereist: %@"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نصب‌شده: %@ · موردنیاز: %@"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Установлено: %@ · Требуется: %@"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installerat: %@ · Krävs: %@"}}}},
    "Instances": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instances"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"实例"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行個體"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instâncias"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instanzen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instancias"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"インスタンス"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"인스턴스"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Instances"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इंस्टेंस"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"المثيلات"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Istanze"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Örnekler"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Екземпляри"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instans"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instancje"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"อินสแตนซ์"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Các phiên bản chạy"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instanties"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نمونه‌ها"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Экземпляры"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instanser"}}}},
    "It answers questions, works with your files and apps, and can chat with you on WhatsApp or Telegram. Setup takes about two minutes.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"It answers questions, works with your files and apps, and can chat with you on WhatsApp or Telegram. Setup takes about two minutes."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它可以回答问题、处理你的文件和应用，还能在 WhatsApp 或 Telegram 上与你聊天。设置大约需要两分钟。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它能回答問題、處理您的檔案並操作應用程式，也能透過 WhatsApp 或 Telegram 與您聊天。設定約需兩分鐘。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ele responde a perguntas, trabalha com seus arquivos e aplicativos e pode conversar com você no WhatsApp ou Telegram. A configuração leva cerca de dois minutos."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Es beantwortet Fragen, arbeitet mit deinen Dateien und Apps und kann mit dir auf WhatsApp oder Telegram chatten. Die Einrichtung dauert etwa zwei Minuten."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Responde preguntas, trabaja con tus archivos y aplicaciones, y puede chatear contigo por WhatsApp o Telegram. La configuración tarda unos dos minutos."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"質問に答えたり、ファイルやアプリを操作したり、WhatsAppやTelegramでチャットしたりできます。セットアップには約2分かかります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"질문에 답하고, 파일과 앱을 활용하며, WhatsApp이나 Telegram에서 대화할 수 있습니다. 설정에는 약 2분이 걸립니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il répond aux questions, travaille avec vos fichiers et vos applications, et peut discuter avec vous sur WhatsApp ou Telegram. La configuration prend environ deux minutes."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"यह सवालों के जवाब देता है, आपकी फ़ाइलों और ऐप्स के साथ काम करता है, और WhatsApp या Telegram पर आपसे चैट कर सकता है। सेटअप में लगभग दो मिनट लगते हैं।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يجيب عن الأسئلة، ويتعامل مع ملفاتك وتطبيقاتك، ويمكنه الدردشة معك على WhatsApp أو Telegram. يستغرق الإعداد نحو دقيقتين."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Risponde alle domande, lavora con i tuoi file e le tue app e può chattare con te su WhatsApp o Telegram. La configurazione richiede circa due minuti."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Soruları yanıtlar, dosyalarınız ve uygulamalarınızla çalışır ve sizinle WhatsApp veya Telegram üzerinden sohbet edebilir. Kurulum yaklaşık iki dakika sürer."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Він відповідає на запитання, працює з вашими файлами й застосунками та може спілкуватися з вами у WhatsApp або Telegram. Налаштування займає близько двох хвилин."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Asisten ini menjawab pertanyaan, bekerja dengan file dan aplikasi Anda, serta dapat mengobrol dengan Anda di WhatsApp atau Telegram. Penyiapan memerlukan waktu sekitar dua menit."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odpowiada na pytania, pracuje z Twoimi plikami i aplikacjami oraz może rozmawiać z Tobą przez WhatsApp lub Telegram. Konfiguracja zajmuje około dwóch minut."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"สามารถตอบคำถาม ทำงานกับไฟล์และแอปของคุณ และแชทกับคุณผ่าน WhatsApp หรือ Telegram ได้ การตั้งค่าใช้เวลาประมาณสองนาที"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trợ lý trả lời câu hỏi, làm việc với các tệp và ứng dụng của bạn, đồng thời có thể trò chuyện với bạn trên WhatsApp hoặc Telegram. Quá trình thiết lập mất khoảng hai phút."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Het beantwoordt vragen, werkt met je bestanden en apps en kan met je chatten via WhatsApp of Telegram. Het instellen duurt ongeveer twee minuten."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"به پرسش‌ها پاسخ می‌دهد، با فایل‌ها و برنامه‌های شما کار می‌کند، و می‌تواند در WhatsApp یا Telegram با شما گفت‌وگو کند. راه‌اندازی حدود دو دقیقه طول می‌کشد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Он отвечает на вопросы, работает с вашими файлами и приложениями и может общаться с вами в WhatsApp или Telegram. Настройка занимает около двух минут."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Den svarar på frågor, arbetar med dina filer och appar och kan chatta med dig på WhatsApp eller Telegram. Konfigurationen tar ungefär två minuter."}}}},
    "Item": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Item"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"项目"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Item"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Element"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elemento"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"항목"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Élément"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आइटम"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"العنصر"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elemento"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Öğe"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Елемент"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Item"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Element"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"รายการ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mục"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"Item"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مورد"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Элемент"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Objekt"}}}},
    "Jobs are saved, but they will not run automatically until `cron.enabled` is set to `true` and the Gateway restarts.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jobs are saved, but they will not run automatically until `cron.enabled` is set to `true` and the Gateway restarts."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"任务已保存，但只有将 `cron.enabled` 设为 `true` 并重启 Gateway 后，才会自动运行。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"工作已儲存，但必須將 `cron.enabled` 設為 `true` 並重新啟動 Gateway，才會自動執行。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As tarefas estão salvas, mas não serão executadas automaticamente até que `cron.enabled` seja definido como `true` e o Gateway seja reiniciado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aufträge werden gespeichert, aber erst automatisch ausgeführt, wenn `cron.enabled` auf `true` gesetzt ist und der Gateway neu startet."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las tareas se guardan, pero no se ejecutarán automáticamente hasta que `cron.enabled` se establezca en `true` y se reinicie Gateway."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ジョブは保存されていますが、`cron.enabled`を`true`に設定してGatewayを再起動するまで、自動では実行されません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작업은 저장되지만, `cron.enabled`를 `true`로 설정하고 Gateway를 다시 시작하기 전까지는 자동으로 실행되지 않습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les tâches sont enregistrées, mais elles ne s’exécuteront pas automatiquement tant que `cron.enabled` ne sera pas défini sur `true` et que le Gateway n’aura pas redémarré."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"जॉब सहेज दिए गए हैं, लेकिन वे अपने आप तब तक नहीं चलेंगे जब तक `cron.enabled` को `true` पर सेट न किया जाए और Gateway पुनः शुरू न हो जाए।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تم حفظ المهام، لكنها لن تُشغّل تلقائيًا حتى يتم تعيين `cron.enabled` إلى `true` وإعادة تشغيل Gateway."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Le attività sono salvate, ma non verranno eseguite automaticamente finché `cron.enabled` non sarà impostato su `true` e il Gateway non verrà riavviato."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Görevler kaydedildi, ancak `cron.enabled` değeri `true` olarak ayarlanıp Gateway yeniden başlatılana kadar otomatik olarak çalışmayacaklar."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Завдання збережено, але вони не запускатимуться автоматично, доки для `cron.enabled` не буде встановлено значення `true` і Gateway не буде перезапущено."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tugas disimpan, tetapi tidak akan berjalan otomatis sampai `cron.enabled` diatur ke `true` dan Gateway dimulai ulang."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zadania są zapisane, ale nie będą uruchamiane automatycznie, dopóki `cron.enabled` nie zostanie ustawione na `true`, a Gateway nie zostanie ponownie uruchomiony."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บันทึกงานแล้ว แต่จะไม่ทำงานโดยอัตโนมัติจนกว่าจะตั้งค่า `cron.enabled` เป็น `true` และรีสตาร์ท Gateway"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Các tác vụ đã được lưu, nhưng sẽ không tự động chạy cho đến khi `cron.enabled` được đặt thành `true` và Gateway khởi động lại."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Taken worden opgeslagen, maar worden pas automatisch uitgevoerd nadat `cron.enabled` is ingesteld op `true` en de Gateway opnieuw is gestart."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"وظایف ذخیره شده‌اند، اما تا زمانی که `cron.enabled` روی `true` تنظیم نشود و Gateway دوباره راه‌اندازی نشود، به‌طور خودکار اجرا نخواهند شد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Задания сохранены, но не будут запускаться автоматически, пока для `cron.enabled` не будет задано значение `true` и Gateway не будет перезапущен."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jobben har sparats, men de körs inte automatiskt förrän `cron.enabled` har ställts in på `true` och Gateway har startats om."}}}},
    "Jump to latest reply": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jump to latest reply"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"跳转到最新回复"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"跳至最新回覆"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ir para a resposta mais recente"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zur neuesten Antwort springen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ir a la última respuesta"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最新の返信に移動"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"최신 답변으로 이동"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aller à la dernière réponse"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नवीनतम जवाब पर जाएँ"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الانتقال إلى أحدث رد"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vai all'ultima risposta"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En son yanıta git"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Перейти до останньої відповіді"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lompat ke balasan terbaru"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Przejdź do najnowszej odpowiedzi"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ไปยังคำตอบล่าสุด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chuyển đến phản hồi mới nhất"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ga naar het nieuwste antwoord"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"رفتن به آخرین پاسخ"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Перейти к последнему ответу"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoppa till senaste svaret"}}}},
    "Keep OpenClaw open while it checks the embedded CUA daemon.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keep OpenClaw open while it checks the embedded CUA daemon."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"检查内嵌 CUA 守护进程时，请保持 OpenClaw 打开。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檢查內嵌的 CUA 常駐程式時，請保持 OpenClaw 開啟。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantenha o OpenClaw aberto enquanto ele verifica o daemon CUA integrado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lass OpenClaw geöffnet, während es den eingebetteten CUA-Daemon überprüft."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantén OpenClaw abierto mientras comprueba el daemon de CUA integrado."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"組み込みのCUAデーモンを確認している間は、OpenClawを開いたままにしてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내장 CUA 데몬을 확인하는 동안 OpenClaw를 열어 두세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gardez OpenClaw ouvert pendant la vérification du démon CUA intégré."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"एम्बेडेड CUA डेमॉन की जाँच होने तक OpenClaw को खुला रखें."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أبقِ OpenClaw مفتوحًا أثناء فحص خدمة CUA المضمّنة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tieni aperto OpenClaw mentre verifica il demone CUA integrato."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gömülü CUA arka plan hizmetini denetlerken OpenClaw'u açık tutun."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не закривайте OpenClaw, поки триває перевірка вбудованого демона CUA."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Biarkan OpenClaw tetap terbuka saat memeriksa daemon CUA bawaan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pozostaw OpenClaw otwarte podczas sprawdzania wbudowanego demona CUA."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เปิด OpenClaw ไว้ขณะตรวจสอบดีมอน CUA ที่ฝังมา"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Giữ OpenClaw mở trong khi ứng dụng kiểm tra daemon CUA tích hợp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Houd OpenClaw open terwijl het de ingebouwde CUA-daemon controleert."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هنگام بررسی سرویس پس‌زمینهٔ تعبیه‌شدهٔ CUA، OpenClaw را باز نگه دارید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не закрывайте OpenClaw, пока идёт проверка встроенного демона CUA."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Håll OpenClaw öppet medan det kontrollerar den inbäddade CUA-daemonen."}}}},
    "Keep OpenClaw visible in the Dock. When off, windows still show the Dock icon while open.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keep OpenClaw visible in the Dock. When off, windows still show the Dock icon while open."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"让 OpenClaw 始终显示在 Dock 中。关闭后，窗口打开时仍会显示 Dock 图标。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"讓 OpenClaw 持續顯示於 Dock。關閉此選項後，只要視窗仍開啟，Dock 圖示仍會顯示。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantenha o OpenClaw visível no Dock. Quando desativado, as janelas ainda exibem o ícone no Dock enquanto estão abertas."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw im Dock sichtbar halten. Wenn deaktiviert, wird das Dock-Symbol weiterhin angezeigt, solange Fenster geöffnet sind."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantén OpenClaw visible en el Dock. Si se desactiva, las ventanas seguirán mostrando el icono en el Dock mientras estén abiertas."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawをDockに常に表示します。オフの場合も、ウィンドウが開いている間はDockアイコンが表示されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dock에 OpenClaw를 계속 표시합니다. 이 옵션을 꺼도 창이 열려 있는 동안에는 Dock 아이콘이 표시됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Garder OpenClaw visible dans le Dock. Lorsque cette option est désactivée, l’icône reste affichée dans le Dock tant que des fenêtres sont ouvertes."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw को Dock में दिखाई देते रहने दें. बंद होने पर भी, विंडो खुली रहने तक Dock आइकन दिखाई देता है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"إبقاء OpenClaw ظاهرًا في Dock. عند إيقاف هذا الخيار، تظل الأيقونة ظاهرة في Dock ما دامت النوافذ مفتوحة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantieni OpenClaw visibile nel Dock. Se disattivato, le finestre mostrano comunque l'icona nel Dock quando sono aperte."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw'u Dock'ta görünür tutun. Kapalı olduğunda, pencereler açıkken Dock simgesi yine gösterilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Показувати OpenClaw у Dock. Коли вимкнено, значок у Dock усе одно відображається, поки відкриті вікна."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tampilkan OpenClaw di Dock. Saat dinonaktifkan, ikon Dock tetap ditampilkan selama jendela terbuka."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pokazuj OpenClaw w Docku. Po wyłączeniu tej opcji ikona w Docku nadal będzie widoczna, gdy okna są otwarte."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"แสดง OpenClaw ใน Dock ไว้เสมอ เมื่อปิดตัวเลือกนี้ ไอคอนจะยังแสดงใน Dock ขณะที่มีหน้าต่างเปิดอยู่"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Giữ OpenClaw hiển thị trên Dock. Khi tắt, các cửa sổ vẫn hiển thị biểu tượng trên Dock khi đang mở."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Houd OpenClaw zichtbaar in het Dock. Wanneer dit is uitgeschakeld, wordt het Dock-symbool nog steeds weergegeven zolang er vensters open zijn."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw را در Dock نمایش دهید. وقتی این گزینه خاموش است، تا زمانی که پنجره‌ها باز هستند، نماد Dock همچنان نمایش داده می‌شود."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всегда показывать OpenClaw в Dock. Если отключено, значок в Dock всё равно отображается, пока открыты окна."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Håll OpenClaw synligt i Dock. När detta är avstängt visas Dock-symbolen ändå så länge fönster är öppna."}}}},
    "Keep my edits": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keep my edits"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留我的修改"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留我的編輯"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manter minhas edições"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Meine Änderungen behalten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conservar mis cambios"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自分の編集を保持"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내 편집 내용 유지"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conserver mes modifications"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"मेरे बदलाव रखें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الاحتفاظ بتعديلاتي"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantieni le mie modifiche"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Düzenlemelerimi koru"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Зберегти мої зміни"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pertahankan editan saya"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zachowaj moje zmiany"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เก็บการแก้ไขของฉันไว้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Giữ các chỉnh sửa của tôi"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mijn wijzigingen behouden"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"حفظ ویرایش‌های من"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сохранить мои правки"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Behåll mina ändringar"}}}},
    "Keeps the last 400 lines and archives the old file.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keeps the last 400 lines and archives the old file."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留最后 400 行并归档旧文件。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留最後 400 行，並封存舊檔案。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantém as últimas 400 linhas e arquiva o arquivo antigo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Behält die letzten 400 Zeilen und archiviert die alte Datei."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conserva las últimas 400 líneas y archiva el archivo anterior."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最後の400行を保持し、古いファイルをアーカイブします。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"마지막 400줄을 유지하고 이전 파일을 보관합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conserve les 400 dernières lignes et archive l’ancien fichier."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आखिरी 400 पंक्तियाँ रखता है और पुरानी फ़ाइल को संग्रहित करता है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يحتفظ بآخر 400 سطر ويؤرشف الملف القديم."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conserva le ultime 400 righe e archivia il vecchio file."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Son 400 satırı korur ve eski dosyayı arşivler."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Зберігає останні 400 рядків і архівує старий файл."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menyimpan 400 baris terakhir dan mengarsipkan file lama."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zachowuje ostatnie 400 wierszy i archiwizuje stary plik."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เก็บ 400 บรรทัดล่าสุดไว้และจัดเก็บไฟล์เก่าเป็นไฟล์ถาวร"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Giữ lại 400 dòng cuối và lưu trữ tệp cũ."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bewaart de laatste 400 regels en archiveert het oude bestand."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"۴۰۰ خط آخر را نگه می‌دارد و فایل قدیمی را بایگانی می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сохраняет последние 400 строк и архивирует старый файл."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Behåller de senaste 400 raderna och arkiverar den gamla filen."}}}},
    "Key": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Key"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"键"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"鍵"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chave"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schlüssel"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clave"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"キー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"키"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clé"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कुंजी"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"المفتاح"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chiave"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anahtar"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ключ"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kunci"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Klucz"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คีย์"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Khóa"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sleutel"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کلید"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ключ"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nyckel"}}}},
    "Kill": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kill"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"终止"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"強制終止"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Encerrar"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beenden erzwingen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terminar"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"強制終了"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"강제 종료"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terminer"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"समाप्त करें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"إنهاء"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Termina"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sonlandır"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Примусово завершити"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hentikan Paksa"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wymuś zakończenie"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บังคับยุติ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Buộc dừng"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beëindigen"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"توقف اجباری"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Завершить принудительно"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tvångsavsluta"}}}},
    "Kill %@ (%d)?": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kill %@ (%d)?"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"终止 %@ (%d)?"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"強制終止 %@ (%d)?"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Encerrar %@ (%d)?"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Beenden von %@ (%d) erzwingen?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Terminar %@ (%d)?"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ (%d)を強制終了しますか？"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ (%d)을(를) 강제 종료할까요?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terminer %@ (%d)?"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ (%d) को समाप्त करें?"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"إنهاء %@ (%d)?"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terminare %@ (%d)?"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ (%d) sonlandırılsın mı?"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Примусово завершити %@ (%d)?"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hentikan paksa %@ (%d)?"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wymusić zakończenie %@ (%d)?"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"บังคับยุติ %@ (%d)?"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Buộc dừng %@ (%d)?"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ (%d) beëindigen?"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"توقف اجباری %@ (%d)؟"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Принудительно завершить %@ (%d)?"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tvångsavsluta %@ (%d)?"}}}},
    "Kind": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kind"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"类型"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"類型"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tipo"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Art"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tipo"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"種類"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"종류"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Type"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"प्रकार"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"النوع"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tipo"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tür"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Тип"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jenis"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rodzaj"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ชนิด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Loại"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Soort"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نوع"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Тип"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Typ"}}}},
    "Known commands can run; new commands use the prompt policy.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Known commands can run; new commands use the prompt policy."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已知命令可直接运行；新命令遵循提示策略。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已知指令可執行；新指令則依提示原則處理。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comandos conhecidos podem ser executados; novos comandos seguem a política de confirmação."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bekannte Befehle können ausgeführt werden; für neue Befehle gilt die Rückfragerichtlinie."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los comandos conocidos pueden ejecutarse; los comandos nuevos usan la política de confirmación."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"既知のコマンドは実行できます。新しいコマンドには確認ポリシーが適用されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"알려진 명령은 실행할 수 있으며, 새 명령에는 확인 요청 정책이 적용됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les commandes connues peuvent s’exécuter ; les nouvelles commandes suivent la politique de demande de confirmation."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ज्ञात कमांड चल सकते हैं; नए कमांड प्रॉम्प्ट नीति का उपयोग करते हैं."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يمكن تشغيل الأوامر المعروفة؛ وتخضع الأوامر الجديدة لسياسة طلب الموافقة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I comandi noti possono essere eseguiti; i nuovi comandi seguono il criterio di richiesta di conferma."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bilinen komutlar çalıştırılabilir; yeni komutlar onay isteme politikasını kullanır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Відомі команди можна виконувати; для нових команд діє політика запитів на підтвердження."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Perintah yang dikenal dapat dijalankan; perintah baru menggunakan kebijakan konfirmasi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Znane polecenia mogą być uruchamiane; nowe polecenia podlegają zasadom pytania o zgodę."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คำสั่งที่รู้จักสามารถทำงานได้; คำสั่งใหม่จะใช้นโยบายการขออนุญาต"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Các lệnh đã biết có thể chạy; các lệnh mới áp dụng chính sách hỏi xác nhận."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bekende opdrachten mogen worden uitgevoerd; nieuwe opdrachten volgen het toestemmingsbeleid."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فرمان‌های شناخته‌شده می‌توانند اجرا شوند؛ فرمان‌های جدید از سیاست درخواست تأیید پیروی می‌کنند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Известные команды могут выполняться; для новых команд применяется политика запроса подтверждения."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kända kommandon kan köras; nya kommandon använder policyn för godkännandeförfrågningar."}}}},
