    "Your AI-powered setup helper. It can check status, fix config, switch models, and connect channels.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your AI-powered setup helper. It can check status, fix config, switch models, and connect channels."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的 AI 设置助手。它可以检查状态、修复配置、切换模型并连接渠道。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的 AI 設定助手。它可以檢查狀態、修正設定、切換模型及連接頻道。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seu assistente de configuração com IA. Ele pode verificar o status, corrigir configurações, trocar modelos e conectar canais."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deine KI-gestützte Einrichtungshilfe. Sie kann den Status prüfen, die Konfiguration korrigieren, Modelle wechseln und Kanäle verbinden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu asistente de configuración con IA. Puede comprobar el estado, corregir la configuración, cambiar modelos y conectar canales."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 搭載のセットアップヘルパーです。状態の確認、設定の修正、モデルの切り替え、チャネルの接続ができます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 기반 설정 도우미입니다. 상태 확인, 구성 수정, 모델 전환, 채널 연결을 할 수 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre assistant de configuration alimenté par l’IA. Il peut vérifier l’état, corriger la configuration, changer de modèle et connecter des canaux."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपका AI-संचालित सेटअप सहायक. यह स्थिति जाँच सकता है, कॉन्फ़िगरेशन ठीक कर सकता है, मॉडल बदल सकता है और चैनल कनेक्ट कर सकता है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مساعد الإعداد المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي. يمكنه التحقق من الحالة وإصلاح الإعدادات وتبديل النماذج وربط القنوات."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il tuo assistente IA per la configurazione. Può controllare lo stato, correggere la configurazione, cambiare modelli e collegare canali."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yapay zeka destekli kurulum yardımcınız. Durumu kontrol edebilir, yapılandırmayı düzeltebilir, modelleri değiştirebilir ve kanalları bağlayabilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш помічник із налаштування на основі ШІ. Він може перевіряти стан, виправляти конфігурацію, перемикати моделі та підключати канали."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Asisten penyiapan berbasis AI Anda. Asisten ini dapat memeriksa status, memperbaiki konfigurasi, mengganti model, dan menghubungkan kanal."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Twój pomocnik konfiguracji oparty na AI. Może sprawdzać stan, naprawiać konfigurację, zmieniać modele i łączyć kanały."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ผู้ช่วยตั้งค่าที่ขับเคลื่อนด้วย AI ของคุณ สามารถตรวจสอบสถานะ แก้ไขการกำหนดค่า สลับโมเดล และเชื่อมต่อช่องทางต่างๆ ได้."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trợ lý thiết lập dùng AI của bạn. Trợ lý có thể kiểm tra trạng thái, sửa cấu hình, chuyển mô hình và kết nối các kênh."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je AI-gestuurde installatiehulp. Deze kan de status controleren, de configuratie herstellen, modellen wisselen en kanalen verbinden."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"دستیار راه‌اندازی شما با پشتیبانی هوش مصنوعی. می‌تواند وضعیت را بررسی کند، پیکربندی را اصلاح کند، مدل‌ها را تغییر دهد و کانال‌ها را متصل کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш ИИ-помощник по настройке. Он может проверять состояние, исправлять конфигурацию, переключать модели и подключать каналы."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Din AI-drivna konfigurationshjälp. Den kan kontrollera status, åtgärda konfigurationen, byta modeller och ansluta kanaler."}}}},
    "Your agent could not be notified yet. OpenClaw will retry after the next app launch.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your agent could not be notified yet. OpenClaw will retry after the next app launch."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时无法通知你的智能体。OpenClaw 将在下次启动应用后重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前尚無法通知你的代理。OpenClaw 將在下次啟動應用程式後重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ainda não foi possível notificar seu agente. O OpenClaw tentará novamente na próxima inicialização do aplicativo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dein Agent konnte noch nicht benachrichtigt werden. OpenClaw versucht es nach dem nächsten App-Start erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no se ha podido notificar a tu agente. OpenClaw lo volverá a intentar la próxima vez que se inicie la aplicación."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"エージェントにまだ通知できていません。OpenClaw は次回のアプリ起動後に再試行します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 에이전트에 알리지 못했습니다. 다음 앱 실행 후 OpenClaw가 다시 시도합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre agent n’a pas encore pu être averti. OpenClaw réessaiera au prochain lancement de l’application."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपके एजेंट को अभी सूचित नहीं किया जा सका. अगली बार ऐप लॉन्च होने के बाद OpenClaw फिर से प्रयास करेगा."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذّر إخطار وكيلك حتى الآن. سيعيد OpenClaw المحاولة عند تشغيل التطبيق في المرة القادمة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Non è stato ancora possibile avvisare il tuo agente. OpenClaw riproverà al prossimo avvio dell'app."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ajanınıza henüz bildirim gönderilemedi. OpenClaw, uygulamanın bir sonraki açılışında yeniden deneyecek."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поки що не вдалося сповістити вашого агента. OpenClaw повторить спробу після наступного запуску застосунку."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agen Anda belum dapat diberi tahu. OpenClaw akan mencoba lagi setelah aplikasi diluncurkan berikutnya."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nie udało się jeszcze powiadomić Twojego agenta. OpenClaw spróbuje ponownie po następnym uruchomieniu aplikacji."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ยังไม่สามารถแจ้งเอเจนต์ของคุณได้ OpenClaw จะลองอีกครั้งหลังจากเปิดแอปครั้งถัดไป."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chưa thể thông báo cho tác nhân của bạn. OpenClaw sẽ thử lại sau lần khởi chạy ứng dụng tiếp theo."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je agent kon nog niet op de hoogte worden gebracht. OpenClaw probeert het opnieuw nadat de app de volgende keer is gestart."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هنوز امکان اطلاع‌رسانی به عامل شما فراهم نشده است. OpenClaw پس از اجرای بعدی برنامه دوباره تلاش می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пока не удалось уведомить вашего агента. OpenClaw повторит попытку после следующего запуска приложения."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Din agent kunde inte meddelas ännu. OpenClaw försöker igen nästa gång appen startas."}}}},
    "Your personal AI assistant, living on your own Mac.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your personal AI assistant, living on your own Mac."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的个人 AI 助手，运行在你自己的 Mac 上。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的個人 AI 助理，就在你自己的 Mac 上。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seu assistente pessoal de IA, no seu próprio Mac."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dein persönlicher KI-Assistent, direkt auf deinem eigenen Mac."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu asistente personal de IA, en tu propio Mac."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ご自身の Mac 上で動作する、あなた専用の AI アシスタント。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"내 Mac에서 실행되는 나만의 AI 어시스턴트."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre assistant IA personnel, installé sur votre propre Mac."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपका निजी AI सहायक, आपके अपने Mac पर."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مساعدك الشخصي بالذكاء الاصطناعي، على جهاز Mac الخاص بك."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il tuo assistente IA personale, sul tuo Mac."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kendi Mac'inizde yaşayan kişisel yapay zeka asistanınız."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш персональний ШІ-помічник, що живе на вашому власному Mac."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Asisten AI pribadi Anda, yang berada di Mac Anda sendiri."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Twój osobisty asystent AI, działający na Twoim własnym Macu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ผู้ช่วย AI ส่วนตัวของคุณที่อยู่บน Mac ของคุณเอง."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trợ lý AI cá nhân của bạn, ngay trên máy Mac của chính bạn."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je persoonlijke AI-assistent, op je eigen Mac."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"دستیار شخصی هوش مصنوعی شما، روی Mac خودتان."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш персональный ИИ-помощник, работающий на вашем Mac."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Din personliga AI-assistent som finns på din egen Mac."}}}},
    "You’re all set!": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You’re all set!"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一切就绪！"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一切就緒！"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tudo pronto!"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles ist bereit!"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¡Todo listo!"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"準備が整いました！"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 준비가 완료되었습니다!"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tout est prêt!"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सब तैयार है!"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أنت جاهز تمامًا!"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"È tutto pronto!"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her şey hazır!"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усе готово!"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semuanya sudah siap!"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wszystko gotowe!"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"พร้อมใช้งานแล้ว!"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bạn đã sẵn sàng!"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je bent er helemaal klaar voor!"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"همه‌چیز آماده است!"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всё готово!"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allt är klart!"}}}},
